## Screen recording audio: degradation notices shown on the recording toolbar and a settings hint.

recording-audio-none = This recording has no sound
recording-audio-mic-unavailable = Microphone unavailable
recording-audio-system-unavailable = System audio unavailable
recording-audio-mic-lost = Microphone interrupted, silent from now on
recording-audio-system-lost = System audio interrupted, silent from now on
recording-audio-mp4-only = Audio is only supported for MP4
